I come out of the room.
Another door opens.
A woman is there.
She looks very kind.
With her is a small dog.
She smiles.
She asks, "Are you new here?"
I say, "Yes, my name is Maya."
"I am new here."
The woman says, "Hello, Maya."
"I am Asha."
"And this is my dog, Moti."
Asha asks, "Where are you from?"
I say, "I am from Mexico."
Asha smiles.
She asks, "Do you need anything?"
I say, "No, thank you."
"Everything is fine right now."
Asha says, "Okay, we are neighbors."
"Good night, Maya."
I say, "Good night, Asha."
They go outside for a night walk.
